      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "We report the clinical and imaging features of a huge deep leiomyoma of the rectus abdominis treated surgically in an 84-year-old man. Hypotheses are put forward to elucidate the etiology of this enigmatic localization, apparently the first described in the literature."},
